# LaTeX build artifacts. Patterns apply in every edition directory.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.bbl
*.blg
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

# The built book. Regenerated by `latexmk -pdf main.tex` in one command, and it
# changes on every build, so tracking it makes every commit look large and the
# diffs are unreadable. Figure PDFs under figs/ ARE tracked, so the book builds
# from a fresh clone without anyone having to run the Python.
main.pdf

